# Product UI (Nura)

When editing **app chrome** (`/app`, `/admin`, shared components except `frontend/`):

1. **Do not** follow Apple HIG, frosted glass, or iOS blue (`#007AFF`). The `apple-design-ui` rule is retired.
2. Follow `.cursor/rules/nura-brand.mdc` for name, color, type, and voice. Do not reintroduce Inter, `#10a37f`, or the **BLS** acronym in user-facing copy (use Free / Set running / visual sets / session controls — not “moving ball” as the default Free pitch).

3. **Layout**: dark sidebar (`#3D4129`), mint canvas (`#EDF9ED` / `#A4EDA5` tint); flat surfaces, 1px borders, 6–8px radius.
   - Accent: `#4A7234` filled controls; sage `#84B067` surfaces and icons; pistachio `#C6D67E` focus only
   - Sentence case labels

4. **Tokens**: CSS variables in `app/globals.css`. **Typography**: **Source Sans 3 only on `/app`** (`.app-shell` and `.auth-shell` remap `--font-display` → sans). **Admin (`.admin-shell`) is Source Sans 3 only** — no Fraunces on page titles, card titles, or KPIs. Fraunces is marketing **home hero title only** (`.fe-hero-title`).

5. **Exclude frontend site**: `app/components/frontend/**`, `app/page.tsx`, `app/privacy/**`, `app/terms/**`, `app/emdr/**`, `app/learn/**`, `app/blog/**`, `app/changelog/**` — those use `.frontend-home` with **Source Sans 3 + Roboto Mono** kickers; Fraunces only on the home hero (see `nura-brand.mdc` → Frontend typography).

6. **UI/UX work**: load `.cursor/skills/nura-ui-designer/SKILL.md` (`/nura-ui-designer`) before restyling or shipping visual changes.
